            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "74. Overtime and Additional Hours - The Employer shall assign overtime and additional hours to employees in any one classification concerned at any one location who have volunteered to be on the list for overtime or additional hours. Such work shall be assigned from the lists in the following order, based upon bargaining unit seniority within the department:",
